*experience* magic, it's that you don't *believe* in magic. Like with
the forbidden potions and wands I mentioned above, you could step on a
polymorph trap once, by accident, and not break the conduct because,
as a pragmatist, you dismiss the entire experience as some sort of
dream. But if you voluntarily seek out polymorph traps to use to your
own advantage, you obviously believe in magic and have therefore
broken the conduct.

